\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. \cf0  Everlasting Love, my mind on
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 my mind on for sympathy
\par It's like a very deep valley.
\par Please keep me so very safe,
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par I pray for your protection
\par drive away all my darkness
\par that have engulfed all my good sight
\par at a time I look for your light.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  2.  Everlasting Love, I'll serve you
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0  Your comparison is great,
\par and out of your own volition
\par took most holy decision.
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6  Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par You delivered all the world
\par out of our bondage and sin
\par give your only begotten Son
\par to die to pave way for us all.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-270\li360\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  3.    O, a big and deep sympathy
\par \pard\li360\sl190\slmult0 that have in it full deep love
\par Through that all people on this earth
\par May have your eternal love.
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Love that cares for His children
\par they have rest in His bosom.
\par He will save all that are stubborn
\par from the everlasting fire.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-315\li360\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par   4.    I looked at my name that you wrote
\par \pard\li360\sl190\slmult0 In thy everlasting book.
\par Then can I meet death anywhere
\par With no panic and no fear.
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par All the earthly things I see,
\par cannot move me from my God,
\par and can not take my property
\par and again your love from my hands.
\par \pard\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

